  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 7th level, when you hit a creature with an improvised weapon, you can apply one of the following debuff effects instead of dealing extra damage (the target must succeed on a Strength or Dexterity saving throw, DC = 8 + your proficiency bonus + your Strength or Dexterity modifier):</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Entangle.</strong> The target's speed is reduced by 10 feet until the end of its next turn.</li>\n<li><strong>Disorient.</strong> The target has disadvantage on its next attack roll before the end of its next turn.</li>\n<li><strong>Blind.</strong> The target is blinded until the end of its next turn.</li>\n</ul>",
